{"files":[{"content":"#include <algorithm>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <iterator>\n#include <string>\n\nstruct PrintPermutation\n{\n    std::string line;\n\n    template <typename Iter> auto\n    operator () (Iter first, Iter last) -> void\n    {\n        line.clear () ;\n        line += \"[ \" ;\n        while (first != last) {\n            line += *first ;\n            line += ' ' ;\n            ++ first ;\n        }\n        line += \"]\\n\" ;\n        std::cout.write (line.data (), static_cast<std::streamsize> (line.size ())) ;\n    }\n} ;\n\nstruct IsWhitespace\n{\n    template <typename Char> auto\n    operator () (Char c) const -> bool\n    {\n        return (c == ' ' )\n            || (c == '\\n')\n            || (c == '\\r')\n            || (c == '\\t')\n            || (c == '\\f')\n            || (c == '\\v') ;\n    }\n} ;\n\ntemplate <typename String> inline auto\nremove_whitespaces (String text) -> String\n{\n    text.erase\n        ( std::remove_if\n            ( text.begin ()\n            , text.end ()\n            , IsWhitespace () )\n        , text.end () ) ;\n    return text ;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename Iter> auto\nfind_longest_non_increasing_suffix (Iter first, Iter last) -> Iter\n{\n    if (first == last) return last ;\n    Iter back = std::prev (last) ;\n    if (back == first) return last ;\n    do {\n        -- last ;\n        -- back ;\n    } while ((first != last) && (*back >= *last)) ;\n    return last ;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename Iter> auto\nfind_rightmost_successor (Iter first, Iter second, Iter last) -> Iter\n{\n    if (second == last) return last ;\n    do {\n        -- last ;\n    } while ((second != last) && (*last <= *first)) ;\n    return last ;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename Iter> auto\nnext_permutation (Iter first, Iter last) -> bool\n{\n    if (first == last) return false ;\n    Iter suffix = find_longest_non_increasing_suffix (first, last) ;\n    if (suffix == first) return false ;\n    if (suffix == last)  return false ;\n    Iter pivot = std::prev (suffix) ;\n    Iter successor = find_rightmost_successor (pivot, suffix, last) ;\n    std::iter_swap (pivot, successor) ;\n    std::reverse (suffix, last) ;\n    return true ;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename Iter, typename Function> inline auto\npermutations_iter (Iter first, Iter last, Function driver) -> void\n{\n    if (first == last) return ;\n    std::sort (first, last) ;\n    do {\n        driver (first, last) ;\n    } while (::next_permutation (first, last)) ;\n    return ;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename String, typename Function> inline auto\npermutations (String text, Function driver) -> void\n{\n    permutations_iter (std::begin (text), std::end (text), driver) ;\n}\n\ntemplate <typename String, typename InStream> inline auto\nread_text_from_stdin (InStream& in) -> String\n{\n    std::istreambuf_iterator <char> begin (in), end ;\n    std::string text (begin, end) ;\n    text = remove_whitespaces (text) ;\n    return text ;\n}\n\nint main (int argc, char const *argv [])\n{\n    std::ios::sync_with_stdio (false) ;\n    std::cin.tie (nullptr) ;\n    std::string text = read_text_from_stdin <std::string> (std::cin) ;\n    permutations (text, PrintPermutation ()) ;\n    return 0;\n}\n","path":"src/permutations.cc"}],"hypothesis":"Outputting each permutation with one buffered write, while disabling C/C++ stream synchronization and avoiding per-line flushes, may improve this output-heavy workload without introducing OpenMP overhead. The earlier measured prefix-parallel attempt was slower, and lexicographic generation plus ordered output constrain useful work sharing.","notes":"This is a bounded serial output experiment after the prior measured parallel-prefix attempt regressed. Output bytes, permutation order, and handling of empty input are preserved. No correctness or speed result is claimed; the controller evaluates the candidate.","research":{"queries":[],"urls":[]},"sources_kept":[],"transformations":["Reuse a string buffer to assemble each formatted permutation line and emit it with a single std::cout.write call.","Replace std::endl flushing with a newline in the buffered line.","Disable iostream synchronization and untie cin from cout." ]}